<title>USA: Universal Foods agrees to buy Tricon.</title>
<headline>Universal Foods agrees to buy Tricon.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Foods Corp said Thursday it agreed in principle to acquire Tricon Colors Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Tricon Colors, with 1996 revenues of $20 million, produces inks for computer printers and dyes for the agricultural, pharmaceutical and cosmetics industries.</p>
<p>Universal said the acquisition is part of its expansion into higher growth, non-food markets, including specialty inks.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
